{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 🛒 Flow Paiement — Côté Client (Navigateur)\n\nTest Playwright validé le 29/03/2026\nClient : armedbased111@gmail.com\nProduit : Arte Jacket Green M — 145€","x":-60,"y":-180,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"step1","type":"text","text":"## 1. Page d'accueil\n`GET /`\n\n- Chargement React SPA\n- Initialisation `CartProvider` (sessionId généré)\n- Modal newsletter → fermer\n- Modal cookie consent → CONTINUER\n\n⚠️ **Bug détecté** : `useLocalStorage` ne persiste pas le sessionId initial → cart perdu à chaque rechargement","x":-60,"y":0,"width":400,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step2","type":"text","text":"## 2. Page Produit\n`GET /product/272`\n\n- Fetch `GET /products/272`\n- Affichage image, prix, description\n- Composant `VariantSelector` (`<select name=\"variant\">`)\n- Composant `AddToCartButton`\n- Sticky sidebar info","x":500,"y":0,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step3","type":"text","text":"## 3. Sélection Taille\n\n- `<select name=\"variant\">` → option `value=\"1180\"` (Green M)\n- `onVariantChange()` → `setSelectedVariant()`\n- `AddToCartButton` passe de disabled → actif\n- Badge stock affiché","x":960,"y":0,"width":360,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step4","type":"text","text":"## 4. Ajout au Panier\n\n- Clic `AJOUTER AU PANIER`\n- `addToCart(variantId=1180, qty=1)`\n- `POST /cart/items` avec header `X-Session-Id`\n- Toast : *\"Ajouté au panier !\"*\n- Cart state mis à jour via `CartContext`","x":1400,"y":0,"width":360,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step5","type":"text","text":"## 5. Page Panier\n`GET /cart`\n\n- Fetch `GET /cart` (X-Session-Id)\n- Affichage : photo, nom, taille, couleur, prix\n- Champ code promo (`applyCoupon`)\n- Résumé : sous-total, livraison, total\n- Bouton **\"Checkout now\"**","x":1840,"y":0,"width":360,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step6","type":"text","text":"## 6. Création Session Stripe\n\n- Clic `Checkout now`\n- `POST /checkout/create-session`\n  - `items: [{variantId:1180, qty:1}]`\n- Backend → crée Stripe Checkout Session\n- Reçoit `{ url: \"https://checkout.stripe.com/...\" }`\n- `window.location.href = url` → redirect","x":2280,"y":0,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"step7","type":"text","text":"## 7. Page Stripe Checkout\n`checkout.stripe.com`\n\n- Produit affiché : Arte Jacket Green M\n- Prix : €145.00\n- Formulaire Stripe géré par Stripe (PCI-DSS)\n- Collecte : email, nom, adresse livraison, téléphone\n- Champ carte dans **iframe sécurisée**","x":2760,"y":0,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"step8","type":"text","text":"## 8. Saisie Informations Client\n\n- Email : armedbased111@gmail.com\n- Nom : Armed Based\n- Adresse : 10 Rue de Rivoli, 75001 Paris\n- Téléphone : +33 6 12 34 56 78\n- Pays : France","x":3240,"y":0,"width":340,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"step9","type":"text","text":"## 9. Saisie Carte Bancaire\n`iframe Stripe sécurisé`\n\n- Carte test : `4242 4242 4242 4242`\n- Expiry : `12/28`\n- CVC : `123`\n- Champ dans iframe `checkout.stripe.com`\n- Chiffrement Stripe côté client\n- PCI-DSS compliant","x":3660,"y":0,"width":340,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"step10","type":"text","text":"## 10. Soumission Paiement\n\n- Clic bouton **\"Pay\"** (Stripe)\n- Stripe valide la carte\n- Crée `PaymentIntent` avec status `requires_capture` (capture manuelle)\n- Déclenche webhook `checkout.session.completed`\n- Redirect vers `success_url`","x":4080,"y":0,"width":380,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"step11","type":"text","text":"## 11. Page Confirmation\n`GET /order-confirmation?session_id=cs_test_...`\n\n- Affichage : *\"COMMANDE CONFIRMÉE\"*\n- Session ID affiché\n- Panier vidé automatiquement\n- Email de confirmation envoyé\n- Commande en statut **PENDING** (en attente capture admin)","x":4540,"y":0,"width":400,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bug","type":"text","text":"## ⚠️ Bug identifié\n\n**`useLocalStorage` ne persiste pas la valeur initiale**\n\nLe `cart_session_id` est généré mais jamais écrit dans `localStorage` au premier montage → à chaque rechargement de page (F5), le cart est perdu car un nouveau sessionId est créé.\n\n**Fix** : Écrire le sessionId dans `localStorage` dès l'initialisation du hook.\n\n`useCart.ts` → `useLocalStorage`","x":-60,"y":280,"width":480,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## Légende\n🟦 Reboul Store (React)\n🟧 API Backend (NestJS)\n🟨 Stripe (externe)\n🟩 Succès\n🟥 Bug / Attention","x":-60,"y":560,"width":260,"height":160}
	],
